{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>From any commandment of YHWH.</b> Our Sages explained: a sin-offering applies only to something whose intentional [violation] is a negative commandment and karet (Sifra)." "<b>From one of them.</b> From a partial [form of] one of them — for example, one who writes on Shabbat the name Shim from Shimon, Nach from Nachor, Dan from Daniel (ibid.)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:52.842276306Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}